: "Screen4.png", "id": "686700530818077", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_686700534151410_8957197507642442114_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kzCCR5coTzYQ7kNvwHYSAjl&_nc_oc=Adl-b4JKIOA8Ref2rDiUkNKyMKOeZ5Z1XYD2sKIl1HiIakMLBB-lFmbyALFnc6mcY64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuOjdkBFQCsvQIX9qewrZUtVAeao5tRHw-IhVbxtJ6GXw&oe=699DB1F6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OpenGateCover.png", "id": "1083210333713788", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1083210337047121_9212582815442388818_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GkR-P4bTmxYQ7kNvwGgcM7L&_nc_oc=Admk_8DsMIVqux9O1-GhMl9bLryxWuy7fCeC_12RENLZ0bKapvqC973qN9jLnH_VtS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfseJ12UXCKGd7qDejaYZB5uk757X6Yf9UWG-zCDAviCpA&oe=699DAE9B"}, "display_name": "OpenGate XR", "keywords": ["builder", "mixed", "opengate", "creator", "editor"], "long_description": "Metagate's OpenGate XR is a webapp that lets you create your own Mixed Reality environment from your smartphone or PC completely independently!\n \n- Register on the webapp (app.themetagate.it) via email or Google.\n- Log in with the same credentials on the OpenGate app on the viewer.\n- Upload images, videos or 3D models that you can interact with in MR (move, scale and save position).\n- Create a 3D travelling companion with customisable artificial intelligence (GPT based) that you can talk to in MR.\n\nSupported formats:\n- Images: png, jpg;\n- Video: mp4;\n- 3D models: glb, fbx.", "short_description": "Create your own experience with the first Mixed Reality builder.\nUpload your assets: images, videos and 3D models. Even add your own AI Avatar. All without code!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://discover.themetagate.it/pages/policy-privacy-opengate-xr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity", "support_website_